#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2001 main.lua:22826
#, fuzzy
msgid "Privacy & Data"
msgstr "Privasi & Data"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2012 main.lua:20660
#, fuzzy
msgid "Trusted Providers: None"
msgstr "Penyedia Tepercaya: Tidak Ada"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2014 main.lua:20662
#, fuzzy
msgid "Trusted Providers: %1"
msgstr "Penyedia Tepercaya: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2017
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Providers you trust bypass all data sharing controls below AND text "
"extraction. All data types (highlights, annotations, notebook, book text) "
"are available without toggling individual settings. Use for local Ollama "
"instances or providers you fully trust.\n"
"\n"
"Trust also satisfies the consent that background features (such as Automatic "
"X-Ray and X-Ray checkpoint builds) check before running; those can then "
"extract text and spend tokens without a per-request tap."
msgstr ""
"Provider yang Anda percayai akan melewati semua kontrol berbagi data di "
"bawah ini SERTA ekstraksi teks. Semua jenis data (sorotan, anotasi, catatan, "
"teks buku) tersedia tanpa perlu mengaktifkan pengaturan satu per satu. "
"Gunakan untuk instance Ollama lokal atau provider yang sepenuhnya Anda "
"percayai.\n"
"\n"
"Kepercayaan juga memenuhi persetujuan yang diperiksa oleh fitur latar "
"belakang (seperti X-Ray Otomatis dan pembuatan checkpoint X-Ray) sebelum "
"berjalan; fitur tersebut kemudian dapat mengekstrak teks dan menggunakan "
"token tanpa konfirmasi per permintaan."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2025
#, fuzzy
msgid "Preset: Default"
msgstr "Prasetel: Default"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2026
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Recommended balance. Share reading progress and chapter info for context-"
"aware features. Personal content (highlights, annotations, notebook) stays "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Keseimbangan yang disarankan. Bagikan progres membaca dan info bab untuk "
"fitur sadar konteks. Konten pribadi (sorotan, anotasi, buku catatan) tetap "
"privat."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2033
#, fuzzy
msgid "Preset: Minimal"
msgstr "Prasetel: Minimal"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2034
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Maximum privacy. Disable all extended data sharing including progress and "
"chapter info. Only your question and book metadata are sent."
msgstr ""
"Privasi maksimum. Nonaktifkan semua berbagi data tambahan termasuk progres "
"dan info bab. Hanya pertanyaan Anda dan metadata buku yang dikirim."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2041
#, fuzzy
msgid "Preset: Full"
msgstr "Prasetel: Penuh"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2042
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enable all data sharing for full functionality. Does not enable text "
"extraction (see Text Extraction submenu)."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan semua berbagi data untuk fungsionalitas penuh. Tidak mengaktifkan "
"ekstraksi teks (lihat submenu Ekstraksi Teks)."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2051
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tip: Per-book overrides"
msgstr "Tip: Penggantian per buku"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2052 main.lua:20552
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every sharing toggle here can be overridden per book (Book Settings → "
"Privacy). Two patterns: keep a global toggle off and allow it for specific "
"books, or keep it on and deny it for sensitive books. A per-book deny always "
"wins — even over trusted providers."
msgstr ""
"Setiap sakelar berbagi di sini dapat ditimpa per buku (Pengaturan Buku → "
"Privasi). Ada dua pola: biarkan sakelar global nonaktif dan izinkan untuk "
"buku tertentu, atau biarkan aktif dan tolak untuk buku yang sensitif. "
"Penolakan per buku selalu menang — bahkan atas provider yang dipercaya "
"sekalipun."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2060
#, fuzzy
msgid "Allow Annotation Notes"
msgstr "Izinkan Catatan Anotasi"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2063
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
