#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2583
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rebuild Data Indexes"
msgstr "Bangun Ulang Indeks Data"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2584
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finds books whose KOAssistant data (artifacts, chats, notebooks, pinned) "
"exists on disk but doesn't show in this device's browsers, e.g. after "
"syncing sidecar files from another device, restoring a backup, or migrating "
"devices.\n"
"\n"
"Checks your reading history, KOReader's sidecar locations, and the scan "
"folders configured below, then removes stale entries. Books on unmounted "
"storage get pruned; run again with the storage mounted to re-add them.\n"
"\n"
"May take a while on large libraries."
msgstr ""
"Menemukan buku yang data KOAssistant-nya (artefak, obrolan, notebook, "
"disematkan) ada di penyimpanan tetapi tidak muncul di penjelajah perangkat "
"ini, misalnya setelah menyinkronkan file sidecar dari perangkat lain, "
"memulihkan cadangan, atau memindahkan perangkat.\n"
"\n"
"Memeriksa riwayat baca Anda, lokasi sidecar KOReader, dan folder pemindaian "
"yang dikonfigurasi di bawah, lalu menghapus entri yang basi. Buku pada "
"penyimpanan yang tidak terpasang akan dipangkas; jalankan lagi dengan "
"penyimpanan terpasang untuk menambahkannya kembali.\n"
"\n"
"Mungkin memerlukan waktu cukup lama pada pustaka besar."

