msgid ""
"How AI Book Tools answer.\n"
"\n"
"Gather then answer: the AI quietly collects passages from the book first, "
"then answers as a normal request: the answer streams and web search stays "
"available.\n"
"\n"
"Interactive: the original agentic loop; the AI narrates its way through "
"lookups; no streaming or web search while tools run."
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana Alat Buku AI menjawab.\n"
"\n"
"Kumpulkan lalu jawab: AI diam-diam mengumpulkan bagian dari buku terlebih "
"dahulu, lalu menjawab seperti permintaan biasa: jawaban ditampilkan secara "
"streaming dan pencarian web tetap tersedia.\n"
"\n"
"Interaktif: alur agen asli; AI menjelaskan proses pencariannya; tidak ada "
"streaming atau pencarian web selama alat berjalan."

